WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:03.720
In 2008, my next guest
became an internet sensation

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:05.390
and Mad TV cast member thanks

00:00:05.390 --> 00:00:07.880
to her viral Nail Salon routine.

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:10.300
Since then, she's appeared
on shows like Superstore,

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.040
Ugly Betty as well as Curb Your Enthusiasm

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:16.480
and released 4 one hour specials already.

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:18.970
On August 20, you can see her hosting,

00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:21.480
The Art of Comedy special which was shot

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:23.701
at the HA Festival in San Antonio.

00:00:23.701 --> 00:00:26.190
Please welcome Anjelah Johnson.

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:28.410
Anjelah thank you for being here.

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:29.660
Thank you for having me.

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:32.810
That was a mouthful sorry to
give you every credit possible.

00:00:32.810 --> 00:00:35.743
All of it. You text me word by word once.

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:40.550
How are you and your husband
handling the quarantine,

00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:41.550
whole lockdown?

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:43.520
You know, we're actually
having a great time

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:46.060
which sometimes I try
not to tell everybody

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:47.770
how much fun we're having
because I know there's

00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:50.170
a lot happening in the world so I like

00:00:50.170 --> 00:00:51.700
to be like "Ah, hate it."

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:54.380
but really I love it so much.

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:58.430
I'm a homebody, love to be home
and we're getting creative.

00:00:58.430 --> 00:01:00.870
Like we all have some celebrated birthdays

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:02.534
in quarantine so far.

00:01:02.534 --> 00:01:05.250
My husband's birthday is July.

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:09.070
