there was other comics there

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:11.470
because I'm used to being
on the road by myself.

00:02:11.470 --> 00:02:15.800
It's me, my opener, my
road manager, and that's it

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:17.380
and then we're on the road.

00:02:17.380 --> 00:02:19.710
And then when we come home, most comics

00:02:19.710 --> 00:02:21.790
will like go hit up the Comedy Store,

00:02:21.790 --> 00:02:23.920
the improv, laugh factory, whatever.

00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:26.650
A lot of times, I just want to be home

00:02:26.650 --> 00:02:28.980
because like I said, I'm
a homebody, I like that.

00:02:28.980 --> 00:02:33.540
So I'll do like dinner with
my friends or just stay home

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:37.755
